  "description": "StudioBlank is an ultra-minimal design system where whitespace is the primary design feature. Built for photographer and visual artist portfolios, every UI element recedes so the work itself commands attention. The system uses no shadows, no border radius, and a monochromatic palette with weight contrast in a single type family. Geometry is pure, grids are strict, and ornamentation is entirely abs",
